  m_Name: unit_61217
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  unitName: Ominous Blade Neviro
  unitId: 61217
  unitNumber: 1695
  description: A master of all manner of sinister techniques, Neviro even taught
    his advanced pupils assassination techniques. Had Neviro won in the sacred La
    Vedan tournament and made his school of fencing the national standard, it would
    have meant the spread of assassination techniques across the La Veda Republic.
    Given that Neviro's sect of fencers were likely involved in political infighting,
    this would have produced a very different history than that of modern La Veda
    fencing. Indeed, with Neviro acting as an advisor to the La Vedan elite, the
    republic doubtless would have entered a dark period in its history.
  summonDesc: Whatever means I must use, they're justified if I win. They just didn't
    understand that.
  fusionDesc: Battle is always cruel. That is why I must win. Whenever, and against
    whomever.
  evoDesc: In battle, victory is justice. When you lose, you die, and that's the
    end. Honorable and righteous? Don't bore me with that!
  element: 6
  rarity: 7
